.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt RANLIB 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ranlib
.Nd write the symbol index of an archive
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl D | U
.Ar archive ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes, in each
.Ar archive ,
the index of the symbols its object files define, which the linker
reads to find them.
It is the same as
.Ql ar s .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl D
Write zero for dates, user and group (the default).
.It Fl U
Write the real ones.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ar 1
.Sh HISTORY
Minkar's
.Nm
is LLVM's llvm-ar under that name.
